{"slug":"The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-TSB-Skill-Creator-Template-52222","_id":"68bf4697e141110900cdf72e","title":"TSB Skill Creator Template","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-c947df5b221c30672c3591247a8c6495-d88fb8427541.png","placeId":10449761463},"features":"This script allows you to very easily make Custom skills/moves in The Strongest Battlegrounds.\n\n( this script should work on all devices and Executors. )","tags":["tsb","The Strongest Battlegrounds","Template","Skill","Creator"],"script":"-- ( ( 𝐒𝐂𝐑𝐈𝐏𝐓 𝐋𝐎𝐀𝐃𝐄𝐑 ) ) --\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rawscripts.net/raw/Universal-Script-Move-Creator-Template-Loadstring-Source-52223\"))()\n\n-- ( ( 𝐓𝐄𝐌𝐏𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐄 ) ) --\nfunction Function()\nprint(\"Your Epic Skill's Functionality\")\nend\ngetgenv().Death_Port_SkillMaker_Create(\"Name\",\"USE TWICE\",5,false,Function)\n--[[ Functions in Order:\narg1 = name\narg2 = use twice text (can be nil)\narg3 = cooldown length\narg4 = if it should be burning (UFW Burning Effect)\narg5 = function to call on equipped (Basically just what your skill does)\n]]\n\n\n--[[ 𝐄𝐗𝐀𝐌𝐏𝐋𝐄 𝐅𝐔𝐍𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘\nfunction Test()\ngame.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = CFrame.new(144.799332, 490.754395, 18.1890182, 0.906309605, 0.422614306, 1.14254601e-06, 2.39172323e-06, -2.42560577e-06, -1, -0.422614306, 0.906309605, -3.20912636e-06)\nend\ngetgenv().Death_Port_SkillMaker_Create(\"Epic\",\"skibidis\",5,true,Test)\n]]","owner":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67af269724d76538a5a97323-1767021867316.png","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/FMxRhhVfXu","views":16993,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/10449761463-1757365911797.png","likeCount":3,